#: ../../language/error_codes/E4067.md:1
msgid "E4067"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4067.md:3
msgid "Missing main function in the main package."
msgstr "main 包中缺少 `main` 函数。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4067.md:5
msgid ""
"In MoonBit, packages are divided into two types: main packages and non-"
"main packages. Non-main packages are often used as libraries to provide "
"functionality to other packages. Main packages, on the other hand, are "
"the entry points of the program. Therefore, a main package should contain"
" a `main` function serving as the entry point of the program."
msgstr ""
"在 MoonBit 中，包分为 main 包和非 main 包两类。非 main 包通常作为库，为其他包提供功能；main "
"包则是程序的入口。因此，main 包应该包含一个作为程序入口的 `main` 函数。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4067.md:11
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4067.md:13
msgid "Suppose in package `main`:"
msgstr "假设在包 `main` 中："

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4067.md:15
msgid "`main/moon.pkg`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4067.md:17
msgid "pkgtype(kind: \"executable\")\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4067.md:21
#: ../../language/error_codes/E4067.md:31
msgid "`main/main.mbt`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4067.md:23
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn helper() -> Unit {\n"
"  ()\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4067.md:27
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4067.md:29
msgid "You can add a `main` function to the main package:"
msgstr "你可以在 main 包中添加一个 `main` 函数："

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4067.md:33
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"priv struct A(Int)\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"fn A::to_int(self : A) -> Int {\n"
"  self.0\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"fn main {\n"
"  let a = A(42)\n"
"  println(a.to_int())\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4067.md:37
msgid ""
"Alternatively, if the package is meant to be a library, remove the "
"`pkgtype(kind: \"executable\")` declaration. Library is the default "
"package type."
msgstr ""
"或者，如果这个包本来应该是库，请移除 `pkgtype(kind: \"executable\")` 声明。库是默认的包类型。"
